  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal singleprofile models with pca_n2000 and resnet50 achieve ~52% accuracy. This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l (a stronger image encoder) while keeping other parameters identical, isolating the effect of image encoder choice. It directly addresses uncertainty about whether the image encoder significantly impacts performance, which is critical for optimizing resource allocation in limited budgets."
